Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.63,0:00:06.03,Episode Title,,0,0,0,,{\pos(629.083,448.246)\\fade(255,0,255,0,850,4650,5380)}Episode 43\N \N\N\N\N\NGānlù Temple
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.98,0:00:38.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,My lord... why do you seem upset?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.00,0:00:43.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Because of your loose tongue, \Nmy plan has been ruined!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.03,0:00:46.64,Default,,0,0,0,,That is my mistake!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.39,0:00:53.11,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(358.044,458.182)\fade(255,0,255,0,400,5340,5700)}Sūn Quán\NStyled: Zhòngmóu
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.83,0:00:53.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Tomorrow, the State Mother will have a gathering at Ganlu temple.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.33,0:00:58.09,Default,,0,0,0,,If she does not like Liu Bei, \Nthat will let me deal with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.57,0:01:00.97,Default,,0,0,0,,But if she likes him,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.48,0:01:07.93,Default,,0,0,0,,our bluff will become reality\N and we will become family!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.95,0:01:14.71,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(292.436,503.377)\fade(255,0,255,0,400,5300,5740)}Lǚ Fàn\NStyled: Zǐhéng
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.58,0:01:11.97,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord, do not worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.48,0:01:17.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Liu Bei is half a century old whilst \Nyour sister is young and beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.63,0:01:20.17,Default,,0,0,0,,How could the State Mother like him?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.13,0:01:24.45,Default,,0,0,0,,With State Elder Qiao around her,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.96,0:01:27.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I cannot say that my mother will decline him.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.83,0:01:33.46,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord, even if the State Mother likes him,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.46,0:01:35.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,she would not accept him as a son-in-law.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.64,0:01:43.62,Default,,0,0,0,,But if that is her wish, how can I even disobey it?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.48,0:01:47.07,Default,,0,0,0,,My liege,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.81,0:01:52.21,Default,,0,0,0,,one cannot ever be completely filial or loyal since antiquity.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.12,0:01:56.82,Default,,0,0,0,,My liege.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.19,0:02:00.06,Default,,0,0,0,,At the meeting at Ganlu temple tomorrow,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.06,0:02:03.62,Default,,0,0,0,,no matter if the State Mother likes him or not, \Nwe cannot keep him alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.20,0:02:08.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I will order Jia Hua to bring 300 men with sabers. They will stand in ambush in the corridor,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.77,0:02:12.75,Default,,0,0,0,,and as soon as you drop a cup as a signal,\Nthey will charge in from both sides.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.75,0:02:16.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Both Liu Bei and Zhao Yun will be slain!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.75,0:02:31.29,Default,,0,0,0,,We have done exactly what the Strategos advised.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.77,0:02:32.37,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(985.245,485.455)\\fade(255,0,255,0,400,4340,4680)}Liú Bèi\NStyled: Xuándé
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.79,0:02:35.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Why come we have not received any news yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.25,0:02:42.13,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(309.765,465)\\fade(255,0,255,0,400,5500,5860)}Zhào Yún\NStyled Zǐlóng
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.66,0:02:39.69,Default,,0,0,0,,The Strategos has divine foresight.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.73,0:02:43.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I think that this case is no different.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.55,0:02:48.35,Default,,0,0,0,,State Elder Qiao visited State Mother Wu this afternoon and will be back soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.09,0:02:50.49,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(304.933,442.597)\\fade(255,0,255,0,400,5060,5380)}Sūn Qián\NStyled: Gōngyòu
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.75,0:02:50.57,Default,,0,0,0,,We will get a response soon enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.61,0:02:51.37,Thinking,,0,0,0,,My lord!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.28,0:02:58.35,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord, State Elder Qiao wishes to inform you
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.35,0:03:01.52,Default,,0,0,0,,that State Mother Wu shall meet you at Ganlu temple tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.26,0:03:10.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.70,0:03:19.56,Default,,0,0,0,,This meeting feels off.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.84,0:03:22.34,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord, I will make preparations beforehand.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.85,0:03:30.05,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord, please get some rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.56,0:04:24.77,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord, you'll meet the State Mother tomorrow. Why don't you retire early?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.50,0:04:31.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Zilong, I am more than 50 years old. \NMy hair is turning gray.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.29,0:04:35.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Sun Quan's sister, however, is of a young age.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.78,0:04:39.12,Default,,0,0,0,,For State Mother Wu, her daughter is her treasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.52,0:04:44.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I fear misfortune at tomorrow's meeting.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.22,0:04:50.09,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord, you have great ambitions in your heart and you have a heroic demeanor.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.13,0:04:55.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I imagine State Mother Wu is not any average person herself
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.47,0:04:58.26,Default,,0,0,0,,and will certainly value your bearing and manners.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.37,0:05:03.77,Default,,0,0,0,,You have the looks of a dragon \Nand a phoenix. You will gain her favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.85,0:05:09.48,Default,,0,0,0,,You really know what to say to console me, Zilong!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.87,0:05:18.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Do not worry, my lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.89,0:05:22.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I will gather 500 men to act as your bodyguard.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.73,0:05:28.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,You should also wear thin armor under your robes just in case.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.70,0:05:33.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I will do as you say.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.82,0:05:34.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Excellent!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.08,0:06:00.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Mother, allow me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.13,0:06:02.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Greetings, State Mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.70,0:06:32.47,Default,,0,0,0,,This way, State Mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.29,0:06:38.45,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(997.527,410.455)\\fade(255,0,255,0,400,3820,4150)}State Elder Qiáo
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.37,0:06:37.61,Default,,0,0,0,,State Elder, has the Imperial Uncle arrived?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.10,0:06:43.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I have just been informed that he is awaiting your summons in front of Mount Beigu.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.98,0:06:47.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell him that I wish to see him now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.42,0:06:48.19,Default,,0,0,0,,As you wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.19,0:06:49.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Let us go in.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.23,0:06:58.55,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.36,0:07:00.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Is everything ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.81,0:07:03.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I have already set the ambush on both sides,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.11,0:07:05.40,Default,,0,0,0,,waiting for you to drop the cup as our signal.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.50,0:07:09.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that everything is set, summon Liu Bei at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.03,0:07:09.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.35,0:07:26.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Is the one in the front dressed in brocade Liu Xuande?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.46,0:07:27.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Indeed he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.30,0:07:40.57,Default,,0,0,0,,His looks are extraordinary.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.65,0:07:55.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Imperial Uncle, right this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.66,0:08:04.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry I bothered you to welcome me in person.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.66,0:08:10.56,Default,,0,0,0,,No need to be so courteous, Imperial Uncle. \NThe State Mother awaits you inside this hall.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.87,0:08:13.66,Default,,0,0,0,,After you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.64,0:08:17.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Imperial Uncle Liu has arrived!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.71,0:08:22.25,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(926.567,315)\\fade(255,0,255,0,400,6000,6000)}State Mother Wú
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.68,0:08:22.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.33,0:08:38.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I pay respects to you, madam.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.90,0:08:41.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Please rise, Imperial Uncle.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.97,0:09:01.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Honorable Marquis, may you have good health.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.62,0:09:07.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Likewise, Imperial Uncle.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.86,0:09:11.12,Default,,0,0,0,,State Elder, I hope you too are in good health.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.40,0:09:16.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Xuande, you have the looks of a dragon and a phoenix
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.59,0:09:18.89,Default,,0,0,0,,and the semblance of Heaven and the Sun.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.89,0:09:22.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Your virtue and benevolence spreads across the land.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.71,0:09:28.84,Default,,0,0,0,,To get such a noble son-in-law is great news, great as Heaven itself!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.07,0:09:33.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You think too highly of me, State Elder.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.62,0:09:38.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Ziheng.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.23,0:09:40.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.76,0:09:43.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I must thank you for your matchmaking.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.56,0:09:49.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Imperial Uncle, where is the other matchmaker?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.23,0:09:51.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Sun Qian is currently waiting outside the hall.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.47,0:09:57.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Invite him in. Let us begin the banquet.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.17,0:09:57.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.34,0:10:01.43,Default,,0,0,0,,State Mother, the banquet is ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.43,0:10:02.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Excellent.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.34,0:10:34.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone, please drink to your heart's content!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.58,0:10:40.47,Default,,0,0,0,,State Mother, State Elder. Cheers.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.26,0:10:48.88,Default,,0,0,0,,State Elder, he truly is a noble son-in-law!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.70,0:10:53.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.96,0:11:30.77,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.77,0:11:33.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Xuande, who is that man?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.00,0:11:35.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Zhao Yun of Changshan.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.37,0:11:38.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Is he the one that rescued Adou
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.78,0:11:42.23,Default,,0,0,0,,fending off thousands of soldiers \Nin Dangyang, at Changban Slope?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.84,0:11:44.16,Default,,0,0,0,,That is Zhao Zilong!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.78,0:11:47.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Zilong and I are as close as brothers.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.98,0:11:52.72,Default,,0,0,0,,-A formidable general! \N-Indeed he is!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.65,0:11:55.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Give him some wine.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.76,0:12:02.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.73,0:12:04.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I am most grateful, State Mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.10,0:12:07.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Fantastic!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.77,0:12:14.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,My lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.37,0:12:16.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I just took a look around the corridors.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.08,0:12:19.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I saw some men in ambush wielding sabers.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.22,0:12:22.94,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems Sun Quan wants to kill you. \NInform the State Mother at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.46,0:12:37.09,Default,,0,0,0,,State Mother, if you want to kill me, then kill me!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.85,0:12:43.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Xuande, why are you saying that?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.04,0:12:45.34,Default,,0,0,0,,There are armed men hiding in the corridors.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.34,0:12:48.12,Default,,0,0,0,,If they're there not to kill me, then what for?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.55,0:12:58.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Please stand, Xuande.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.30,0:12:59.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, State Mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.79,0:13:08.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Zhongmou.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.33,0:13:14.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Xuande will soon be my son-in-law and shall be like my own flesh and blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.60,0:13:17.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do you have assassins ambushing in the corridors?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.47,0:13:20.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I have no clue!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.17,0:13:23.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Is this your doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.34,0:13:29.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Ziheng... you would dare to ruin my excitement
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.35,0:13:32.19,Default,,0,0,0,,by killing Xuande before me?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.41,0:13:34.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You must have some nerve!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.32,0:13:40.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Kill them!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.56,0:13:44.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Jia Hua! Do you intend to rebel?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.94,0:13:54.50,Default,,0,0,0,,The cup was thrown to signal me. \NI was just following orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.02,0:14:08.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Take him away.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.19,0:14:13.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Take him away! Off with his head!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.65,0:14:16.58,Default,,0,0,0,,State Mother! State Mother! This is a misunderstanding!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.58,0:14:20.39,Default,,0,0,0,,State Mother, executing a major general is ill luck for our marriage!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.20,0:14:29.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Madame, if you insist, I will remain on my knees!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.27,0:14:31.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Xuande, please stand up.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.21,0:14:37.32,Default,,0,0,0,,State Mother, please calm yourself! Calm yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.58,0:14:40.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, have some mercy, State Mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.59,0:14:48.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, State Mother!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.13,0:14:54.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Jia Hua, were it not for the Imperial Uncle, I would have taken your worthless head!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.34,0:15:00.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I owe you my life, State Mother!\N Thank you, Imperial Uncle!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.64,0:15:08.17,Default,,0,0,0,,State Mother, State Elder, please sit.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.62,0:15:49.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me a sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.85,0:15:50.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Here you go, my lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.45,0:16:09.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord10.909\pos(640,670)}Oh, great Heaven above!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.05,0:16:11.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord10.909}{\pos(640,670)}If I am to safely return to Jing Province
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.12,0:16:12.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,670)}{\bord10.909}and fulfill my imperial designs,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.82,0:16:15.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord10.909}may I split this rock in two with a swing of my sword!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.42,0:16:17.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,670)}{\bord10.909}If I am to perish in this land
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.09,0:16:18.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,670)}{\bord10.909}may the rock remain whole!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.76,0:16:34.29,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.17,0:16:42.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Xuande, why are you so violent to a rock?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.98,0:16:51.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord10.909}I am almost 50, but I have\Nnot yet killed the villains of the land
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.15,0:16:53.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,670)}{\bord10.909}and restored the house of Hàn.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.23,0:16:54.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,670)}{\bord10.909}I find it most regrettable!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.74,0:17:00.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord10.909}Now that the State Mother \Naccepts me as her son-in-law,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.24,0:17:01.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,670)}{\bord10.909}I am most fortunate.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.27,0:17:05.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,670)}{\bord10.909}I was just asking Heaven to predict my future:
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.75,0:17:07.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,670)}{\bord10.909}if I can defeat the Cao and revive the Han,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.89,0:17:09.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,670)}{\bord10.909}it would let me split that rock in two!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.89,0:17:12.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,670)}{\bord10.909}I did not think it would actually work.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.40,0:17:28.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,670)}{\bord10.909}Then I shall ask Heaven about my future.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.81,0:17:34.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord10.909}If I can kill the traitor \NCao Cao, let me cut this rock!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.36,0:17:43.75,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,670)}{\bord10.909}Oh, Heaven,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.75,0:17:46.21,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,670)}{\bord10.909}if I can seize Jing Province and make Wu great,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.21,0:17:48.21,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,670)}{\bord10.909}let me slice this rock!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.49,0:18:04.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Zhongmou, your swordsmanship is on point.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.88,0:18:11.20,Default,,0,0,0,,The same can be said of yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.60,0:18:21.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Xuande, do you know the landscape of Mount Beigu?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.14,0:18:24.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I have never seen it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.68,0:18:27.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Then follow me, Lord Xuande.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.81,0:18:29.24,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.33,0:18:55.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,670)}{\bord10.909}This is the most beautiful landscape in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.49,0:19:01.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,670)}{\bord10.909}I often hear people say
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.67,0:19:04.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord10.909}"Southerners sail on boats; \Nnortherners ride horses."
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.89,0:19:08.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,670)}{\bord10.909}Now I see those words were not false after all!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.71,0:19:15.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord10.909}Lord Xuande, do you believe southerners are not used to riding horses?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.53,0:19:19.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring me my steed.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.44,0:19:27.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Who says southerners cannot ride horses?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.09,0:19:32.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Very well. I shall accompany you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.45,0:20:20.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Chief Commander! The State Mother has \Naccepted Liu Bei. The marriage shall go through.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.13,0:20:25.33,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(381.475,489.35)\\fade(255,0,255,0,400,3820,4180)}Zhōu Yú\NStyled: Gōngjǐn
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.67,0:20:30.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is Liu Bei now?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.90,0:20:32.93,Default,,0,0,0,,He is still inside his lodging in Nanxu.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.93,0:20:37.05,Default,,0,0,0,,We were sent by the Marquis of Wu \Nto tell you that the beauty ruse backfired.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.51,0:20:40.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell the Marquis of Wu to keep watch around the lodging house.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.57,0:20:42.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Do not let Liu Bei leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.41,0:20:44.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Wait for an opportunity to act. Do not delay.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.85,0:20:45.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.36,0:20:53.98,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord, State Elder Qiao informs us that
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.98,0:20:57.39,Default,,0,0,0,,the State Mother chose the 26th day of this month for the marriage.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.39,0:20:59.51,Default,,0,0,0,,It is ten days from now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.36,0:21:05.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Very well. That decision has\N been finalized, so I should be at ease.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.63,0:21:11.31,Default,,0,0,0,,However, I fear such a long delay spells disaster for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.58,0:21:16.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You have the State Mother's favor;\N Sun Quan will not dare change things himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.23,0:21:20.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Zhou Yu is bullheaded and his plan has failed.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.25,0:21:21.65,Default,,0,0,0,,He won't give up easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.99,0:21:28.39,Default,,0,0,0,,He has likely planned another way to harm you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.90,0:21:38.46,Default,,0,0,0,,This requires the help of State Elder Qiao.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.04,0:21:42.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Gongyou, meet State Elder Qiao tomorrow morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.54,0:21:45.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell him that many in Eastern Wu want to harm me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.04,0:21:47.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Ask him to think of a way to help me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.35,0:21:49.46,Default,,0,0,0,,As you wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.88,0:21:54.21,Default,,0,0,0,,State Mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.75,0:21:55.93,Default,,0,0,0,,State Elder.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.58,0:22:02.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Xuande fears that there are those that want to hurt him. He wants to return to Jing Province soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.10,0:22:12.82,Default,,0,0,0,,And who would be bold enough to touch even a hair from my son-in-law?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.27,0:22:19.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Even so, it is best to be cautious.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.95,0:22:26.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Invite Xuande to move to my residence for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.46,0:22:29.11,Default,,0,0,0,,We will wait for the day of the marriage.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.11,0:22:30.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.39,0:22:35.34,Default,,0,0,0,,But if the Imperial Uncle comes alone,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.16,0:22:40.27,Default,,0,0,0,,and does not bring Zhao Yun and his cadre, \Nnobody will be able to contain them.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.39,0:22:43.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Sooner or later, problems may arise.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.47,0:22:46.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Then tell them all to move with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.53,0:22:48.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Excellent! Excellent!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.75,0:22:50.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Come, let us oversee it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.89,0:23:06.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Chief Commander!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.59,0:23:09.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Chief Commander!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.09,0:23:12.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Zijing, what is the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.53,0:23:17.17,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(315.868,508.051)\\fade(255,0,255,0,400,3400,3620)}Lǔ Sù\NStyled: Zǐjìng
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.90,0:23:16.49,Default,,0,0,0,,The State Mother has led Liu Bei and Zhao Yun to reside in her mansion!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.49,0:23:18.45,Default,,0,0,0,,The marriage will happen soon!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.87,0:23:20.19,Default,,0,0,0,,What!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.39,0:23:37.48,Default,,0,0,0,,How did Liu Bei get a step ahead of us again?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.83,0:23:41.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Our lord has sent someone \Nto ask you what we should do.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.88,0:24:00.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I have let down our lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.15,0:24:09.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that it has come to this,\N give me some time to plan it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.16,0:24:54.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Begin the ceremony!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.47,0:25:06.69,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord10.909}Beautiful flowers in the spring forests; the spring birds sing with sorrow;
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.47,0:25:06.69,Song,,0,0,0,,{\k141}Chūn {\k151}lín {\k85}huā {\k75}duō {\k159}mèi, {\k43}chūn {\k120}niǎo {\k78}yì {\k77}duō {\k271}āi
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.83,0:25:15.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome the bride!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.83,0:25:17.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome the groom!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.43,0:25:18.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome to the bride!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.63,0:25:19.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome, groom!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.69,0:25:19.47,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord10.909\pos(640,660)}The tender spring breeze gently blows my skirt.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.09,0:25:19.47,Song,,0,0,0,,{\k148}Chūn{\k164}fēng {\k73}fù {\k76}duō{\k164}qíng, {\k47}chuī {\k105}wǒ {\k103}luō {\k94}shang {\k264}kāi
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.47,0:25:32.07,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord10.909}In the morning I ascend to the balcony, and at dusk I rest in a pond of orchids.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.47,0:25:32.07,Song,,0,0,0,,{\k182}Cháo {\k151}dēng {\k81}liáng{\k85}tái {\k149}shàng, {\k45}xī {\k121}sù {\k87}lán {\k77}chí {\k282}lǐ
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.07,0:25:43.87,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord10.909}Under the moon I pluck hibiscus, and every night, I gather lotuses.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.22,0:25:43.87,Song,,0,0,0,,{\k173}Chéng {\k162}yuè {\k86}cǎi {\k67}fú{\k157}róng, {\k37}yè {\k110}yè {\k77}dé {\k98}lián{\k198}zǐ
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.25,0:26:09.95,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord10.909}I lift my head to look at the empress tree \Nand gaze at its flowers with regret.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.72,0:26:09.95,Song,,0,0,0,,{\k144}Yǎng {\k159}tóu {\k99}kàn {\k64}tóng {\k143}shù, {\k48}tóng {\k128}huā {\k70}tè {\k96}kě{\k272}lián{\k0}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.95,0:26:22.43,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord10.909}How I wish Heaven does not bring snow so that I may contemplate them for a thousand years!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.15,0:26:22.43,Song,,0,0,0,,{\k167}Yuàn {\k151}tiān {\k84}wú {\k76}shuāng {\k129}xuě, {\k74}wú {\k110}zi {\k88}jiě {\k88}qiān{\k261}nián
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.43,0:26:35.23,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord10.909}The pool of ice is three {\i0}chi {\i1}thick.\N White snow spreads over a thousand{\i0} li.{\i1}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.93,0:26:35.23,Song,,0,0,0,,{\k166}Yuān {\k162}bīng {\k76}hòu {\k66}sān {\k154}chǐ, {\k52}sù {\k112}xuě {\k82}fù {\k78}qiān{\k282}lǐ
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.23,0:26:47.75,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord10.909}My feelings are resilient like the pine leaves, \Ndoes my beloved think the same?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.43,0:26:47.75,Song,,0,0,0,,{\k170}Wǒ {\k170}xīn {\k74}rú {\k70}sōng{\k152}bǎi, {\k40}jūn {\k112}qíng {\k90}fù {\k104}hé {\k250}sì
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.78,0:27:01.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord10.909\pos(640,670)}The rite may be modest, but the ceremony is grand.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.25,0:27:10.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord10.909}We venerate Heaven as the Earth is subservient, \Njust as the subjects venerate their sovereign.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.67,0:27:18.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord10.909}The man shall engage with the woman in marriage, like a phoenix joining with the dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.51,0:27:24.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord10.909}Since these rites were established, households have been joyful and the state flourishing.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.03,0:27:35.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord10.909}The newly wed shall pay their respects to Heaven and Earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.69,0:27:51.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Kneel.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.36,0:28:09.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Stand up.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.41,0:28:25.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Bow to your parents.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.98,0:28:29.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Kneel.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.42,0:28:42.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Stand up.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.66,0:28:46.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Bow to the matchmakers.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.22,0:29:01.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Bride and groom, bow to each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.95,0:29:09.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Kneel.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.83,0:29:19.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Stand up.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.77,0:29:26.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring the newly wed to the bridal chamber.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.73,0:29:52.26,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord, do take good care of yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.36,0:29:55.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Zilong, you may drink wine in peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.12,0:30:50.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,What is the meaning of this?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.43,0:31:09.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,My good sir, no need to worry. The mistress has studied military matters since she was a child.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.23,0:31:14.37,Default,,0,0,0,,She often orders her maids to fence for fun. \NThat is what they are doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.64,0:31:18.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,The bridal chamber is a peaceful place.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.99,0:31:22.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Having troops and shows of might here seems chilling.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.95,0:31:26.69,Default,,0,0,0,,My lady, there are weapons inside the chamber.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.69,0:31:29.99,Default,,0,0,0,,It makes your husband uneasy. \NShall they be removed?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.20,0:31:35.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You have been braving\N battlefields for half of your life,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.08,0:31:37.36,Default,,0,0,0,,yet you fear these weapons? Take them away.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.53,0:31:38.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Take them away.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.61,0:31:41.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, enter the chamber.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.01,0:33:28.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Cheers, my dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.55,0:34:05.71,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you looking at, Imperial Uncle?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.72,0:34:10.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it because my looks displease you?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.99,0:34:12.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Not at all! Not at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.83,0:34:17.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I have roamed the land my whole life.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.39,0:34:20.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I never imagined that I would encounter such good fortune.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.27,0:34:24.03,Default,,0,0,0,,My husband...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.36,0:34:31.09,Default,,0,0,0,,You have been involved with warfare \Nall your life, between swords and sabers.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.78,0:34:36.77,Default,,0,0,0,,You have fought and killed. Why is it \Nthat some arms make you so upset?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.72,0:34:44.45,Default,,0,0,0,,The bridal chamber is not the battlefield.\N Why would I see weapons there?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.49,0:34:55.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,My lady, it is my wish that this beautiful moment accompanies me for the rest of my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.60,0:35:35.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Chief Commander.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.47,0:35:39.94,Default,,0,0,0,,The Marquis of Wu has sent me to deliver this letter.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.93,0:36:01.10,Default,,0,0,0,,The fake marriage is real now.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.37,0:36:04.66,Default,,0,0,0,,The Marquis deeply regrets it.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.61,0:36:16.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Your wisdom is above that \Nof common men, Chief Commander.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.47,0:36:19.22,Default,,0,0,0,,How can you let Liu Bei \Nand Zhuge Liang get away with this?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.38,0:36:23.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Zhuge Liang is celebrating victory too soon!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.89,0:36:26.81,Default,,0,0,0,,What is your plan, Chief Commander?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.90,0:36:32.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,How do Liu Bei and Lady Sun get along?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.73,0:36:34.92,Default,,0,0,0,,They stick to each other like lacquer.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.13,0:36:42.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Very well. Since that is the case, let Liu Bei soften up in Eastern Wu.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.11,0:36:46.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Her lavish palaces shall be the tomb of his ambition.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.38,0:36:51.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Give him beautiful women\N and treasures to entertain him.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.25,0:36:58.12,Default,,0,0,0,,That will cause Liu Bei to indulge in pleasure\N and distance him from Guan Yu and Zhang Fei.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.62,0:37:01.15,Default,,0,0,0,,They will resent his proximity to Zhuge Liang.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.46,0:37:05.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I will then send an expedition to Jing\N and thus fulfill our great cause!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.73,0:37:11.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Excellent plan. However, Liu Bei is a man of both ability and ambition.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.20,0:37:14.99,Default,,0,0,0,,If he does not give in, what could we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.43,0:37:21.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Liu Bei has had meager possessions since he was born.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.15,0:37:27.14,Default,,0,0,0,,He has been running throughout\N the world without enjoying life.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.28,0:37:34.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,If we guide him towards it, will he really not give in?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.35,0:37:40.30,Default,,0,0,0,,He shall give in!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.11,0:37:51.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.45,0:37:59.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Very good!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.78,0:38:04.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Gongjin's plan is just what I intended.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.25,0:38:11.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I just fear Liu Xuande will not stay here for long.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.06,0:38:13.48,Default,,0,0,0,,According to this plan,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.48,0:38:18.77,Default,,0,0,0,,if we build him palaces and grant him precious gifts,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.77,0:38:23.07,Default,,0,0,0,,he will focus on good music and women. \NThose playthings will bury his ambitions.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.94,0:38:27.40,Default,,0,0,0,,He will grow soft and lose all desire to go back.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.15,0:38:35.24,Default,,0,0,0,,As time goes on, the officers of Jing \Nwill grow dissatisfied and demoralized.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.89,0:38:40.55,Default,,0,0,0,,If we mobilize the troops then, we can conquer Jing!

